Z||000008||RedOktober||08-26-2000||05:37 AM||||I had 295/50 15 on a kit car once. The thing bounced all over the place. even with only 20 psi in em. Those tires are designed for Full sized Vans and old hot rods. <BR>I personally do not recommend them but if you do yo will need to mount them on a 15 X 8 wheel or wider. Since Fiero's dont come with factory wheels that wide and there are not too many companies making 15" wheels with a 5X100mm bolt pattern you will need to get some wheel adaptors and run a chevy 4-3/4 bolt patern.<BR>Dont expec any performance out of them. Just for show. Hope this helps.||||reg||1
